Jer 17:1 , The captivity of Judah for her sin;
Jer 17:5 , Trust in man is cursed;
Jer 17:7 , in God is blessed;
Jer 17:9 , The deceitful heart cannot deceive God;
Jer 17:12 , The salvation of God;
Jer 17:15 , The prophet complains of the mockers of his prophecy;
Jer 17:19 , He is sent to renew the covenant in hallowing the sabbath.
